	)
	(text_box "\n			 				ESP32S3 PIN PECULIARITIES\n						----------------------------------\n\n	**	GPIOs 34-39 are INPUT ONLY  **\n	**	GPIO26 **RESERVED** ( used internally PSRAM CS  **\n\n	** Strapping pins (read at boot, freed for use after reset) **\n\n		Pin		| Default	|	Function\n		----------------------------------------\n		GPIO0 	|	PU 		|	RUN/bootloader\n		GPIO3 	|	Float 	|	JTAG source (0=external)*  \n		GPIO45	|	PD 		|	VDD_SPI voltage (0=3V3, 1=1V8)*\n		GPIO46	|	PD 		|	0=bootloader download 1=undefined\n\n		*Function can be disabled by EFuse\n\n 	More detail at https://github.com/atomic14/esp32-s3-pinouts\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 121.92 0)
		(size 76.2 44.45)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
